
  ide keys  (prefix = Ctrl+b, press it, release, then the key)

  Projects
    prefix p / Alt+p    open a project from ~/dev (fuzzy search),
                        or a workspace of several repos (*.cockpit)
    Alt+1..9            go to project 1..9 (or click its tab)
    prefix w            jump to the next agent waiting for you
    prefix X            close this project (not reopened next time)

  Inside a project
    Alt+a               hop between editor and agent
    Alt+z               zoom the current pane (again: back)
    prefix + / - / =    agent wider / narrower / back to 25%
    prefix g / Alt+g    lazygit for this file's repo (q closes)
    prefix t            a normal shell in a popup (exit closes)

  Tabs:  ◐ agent working   ● your turn   ! needs approval

  Session
    prefix d            detach (everything keeps running)
    ide                 reattach / after a reboot: reopen all projects
                        and continue each agent's last conversation

  (press any key)
